{
  "title": "3-step CPCA",
  "description": "Data and MATLAB analysis code for the paper \"Item-specific overlap between hallucinatory experiences and cognition in the general population: A three-step multivariate analysis of international multi-site data\" (Cortex, 2021). The data are an anonymized subset of a large international multi-site dataset: measures from consonant-vowel dichotic listening, matrix reasoning, a source memory task, backwards digit span and auditory signal detection (lab data collection only), with item-level responses to the Cardiff Anomalous Perceptions Scale (CAPS) and the Launay-Slade Hallucination Scale - Extended (LSHS-E). Age is binned and gender removed. Main.m reproduces the analyses, figures and tables of the paper. The full dataset of the original study is on OSF: https://osf.io/eqy76/",
